WEBVTT

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:20.570
Things are moving so fast.

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:22.240
The moments ticking by.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:24.080
I'm running through this city.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.910
To me, a savanna.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:27.250
Like it's struggling...

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.250
... trying to break free...

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:32.580
... I wanna test all this power!

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.250
I know that "The Answer"...

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:36.590
... is out there someplace.

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:39.930
The answer that everyone looks for...

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:43.430
... from the day they're born.

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:45.100
When all looks lost...

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:46.600
... and there's no escape...

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.270
... I turn to my dreams!

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:53.100
I'm not afraid of getting hurt...

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:56.440
... but I'm not strong, either.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:59.950
It's just that I can't stand...

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:03.380
... just doing nothing anymore!

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:06.890
Here we go, go! I'll just run on...

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:10.560
... and let nobody stop me now!

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:13.730
I wanna find the me in the future...

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:18.890
... and give her a reason for life!

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:54.550
Hey, lady! I'll have lunch A,
triple portion!

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:56.720
Yeah! Triple portion for me, too!

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.220
There. Sorry for the wait.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:01:59.890
Let's eat!

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:01.660
All right!

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:02.830
Outta my way!

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:04.830
Ever hear of the word
"restraint", Lina?!

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:06.000
And what does that mean?!

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:06.660
By the way, Lina.

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.830
Are you planning to stay
in this city for a while?

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:10.990
Yeah, I am! What about it?!

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:16.010
Jeez, how many times do I have to
explain this, jellyfish brains?!

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:18.170
- There's my opening!
- Oh, no!

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:21.350
I don't know what's going on,
but now's my chance!

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:22.680
Fight! A fight!

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:25.670
My food...

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:34.030
My... food!

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:35.520
Dil Brando!

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:37.530
What the-?

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:39.030
What's the big idea?!

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:42.370
You guys are free to have a fight
anywhere you want to...

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:45.200
...but involving other
people in your fight...

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.540
...and then interfering with an innocent
girl's meal is unforgivable!

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:51.040
Moreover, when you decide
to mess with Lina Inverse...

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:54.710
...consider yourself lucky
to get off this easy!

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:55.710
What did you say?!

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:56.870
Hold it!

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.990
M- M- My sword's been sliced!

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:04.820
Waving those things around
in a city is dangerous, pal.

00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:06.990
Besides, if you go and just
pick a fight with her...

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:08.990
...you don't know what
she may end up doing!

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:11.160
Hey! I heard that, Gourry!

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:14.170
Even if you say that,
I ain't backin' out now!

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:16.500
Now we'll really let you have it!

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.170
They really should stop, you know?

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:24.080
"The Sudden Pinch!
The Terror of the Monstrous Zoamelgustar!"

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:38.020
Father! In the name of Seyruun...

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:41.030
...I shall see this mission
through successfully!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.520
Fight! A fight!

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:45.030
A fight?

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:48.530
It's incredible! Some girl
who looks about 15 or 16...

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:52.040
...is taking on two really huge guys!

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.370
Really? Wow!

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:57.710
It's been months since I left
Miss Lina and the others.

00:03:57.710 --> 00:04:00.200
I wonder what they're
all doing now.

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:04.800
Yes, yes... She sounded
just like that...

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:07.650
Lina Inverse Smash!

00:04:14.490 --> 00:04:17.830
Y- You little bitch!
You're not half bad!

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:20.320
Boo Brymer!

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:23.670
Wh- What?

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:26.160
Go get'em, big boy!

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:36.680
Well, I'd say that's that.

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:39.520
M- Miss Lina?!

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:40.680
Amelia?

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:42.520
Miss Lina!

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:44.690
It's been so long!

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:47.690
What are you doing here, Amelia?
Nice dress, by the way.

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:49.530
Well, if it isn't Amelia.

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:50.530
Oh, Mr. Gourry, too!

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:51.860
Hi!

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:54.030
I see you haven't changed a bit.

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:55.200
Yeah, well.

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:58.200
Still, I never imagined
I'd meet you again here!

00:04:58.200 --> 00:04:59.700
What are you doing here?

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:01.140
What do you mean?

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:04.480
To see the magical Book of Xoana,
of course!

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:06.810
Isn't that why you're here, Amelia?

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:09.650
Actually, Daddy sent me to-

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:15.320
Um, I mean, I came to see
the Book of Xoana, too!

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:16.490
Uh, gotta go.

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:20.320
Going somewhere. Nearby...

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:22.820
Anyway... Gotta run!

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:27.330
What's with her?

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:31.670
Father!

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:34.510
Has the messenger from
Seyruun arrived yet?

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:39.840
Yes... Philionel sent
his own daughter here.

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:45.520
Meaning that Seyruun still isn't
convinced of our hostile intentions?

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:50.690
Well, who can say?
He doesn't fall for every trick.

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:53.190
But, no matter how Seyruun
moves against us...

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:55.860
...eventually the world
will be mine!

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:59.020
Exactly, Father...

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:16.310
Anyway, Martina...

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:18.150
Yes, Father?

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:20.990
Can't you please move
this relief outside?

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:23.490
It's just so creepy, you know?

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:25.820
What? Don't you think
it looks wonderful?

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:29.160
It's my patron monster,
Zoamelgustar.

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:32.500
I won't argue with your tastes, dear...

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:36.000
...but it's a bit much to decorate
my throne room with it.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.500
- Request denied!
- I see...

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:42.510
Anyway, about the messenger
from Seyruun...

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:46.810
Oh, her. I'm sure we can
handle a young girl or two.

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:49.850
Shall we take
Philionel's daughter hostage...

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:53.350
...and then immediately
attack Seyruun?

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:57.020
I've heard that Philionel's daughter
is a skilled sorceress.

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:58.860
What if she isn't that
easy to capture?

00:06:58.860 --> 00:07:03.130
We needn't worry no matter
how good a sorceress she is.

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:05.290
Right, my dear sorcerer?

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:11.460
Wonderful...

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:16.640
Amelia was acting so
obviously strange...

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:19.140
Well, she always
acts sorta strange,

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:20.140
but even so...

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:24.820
She was almost acting like
she's really involved in something...

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:28.150
That's gotta be it!
That girl's up to something!

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:30.320
And she doesn't want us
getting mixed up in it!

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:32.490
That's why she suddenly went
all formal and distant on us.

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:33.820
Really...

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:35.490
It's the only thing
I can think of!

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:39.000
But Amelia swore that
she'd always follow me!

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.000
When? When did she ever
swear that?

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:44.840
Anyway, now that we know this,
we're gonna help her out!

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:45.840
Huh?!

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:46.340
What?

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:50.170
Well... I was thinking that's just so...
upright for you to say.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:53.840
Hey, I can be upright
once in a while!

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:54.850
Besides!

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:55.850
Besides?

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:59.680
That girl's a princess of Seyruun.

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:00.620
If things turn out right...

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:04.290
...I can get a preferential look
at the Book of Xoana!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:07.460
And just what is this
"Book of Xoana," anyway?

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:11.630
Oh, how many times do I have to
explain this, yogurt for brains?!

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:12.800
Wanna taste?

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.470
No!

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.300
The whole reason I came to this city
in the first place...

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:19.300
...was so that I could see
the magical Book of Xoana.

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:21.970
Of all books of sorcery,
without exception...

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:23.970
...the most famous one
is the Claire Bible.

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:26.140
It had several connections
with the revival...

00:08:26.140 --> 00:08:29.310
...of the Demon Lord Shabranigdo
1000 years ago.

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:34.320
They say the Book of Xoana
is almost as valuable.

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:36.650
The book was entrusted
to this kingdom...

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:40.160
...and they only allow the public
to see it once every 50 years.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.660
So there's no way
I'm gonna miss seeing it!

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:44.830
So, do you get it now?!

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.500
Oh, sorry. I wasn't listening.

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.160
Dil Brando!

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:59.510
Oh, I wish I could have been
more honest with Miss Lina...

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:04.110
Still, I'm here this time as
Seyruun's ambassador!

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:08.450
If Miss Lina, the chaos and destruction
poster girl, gets involved here...

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:10.780
Oh, I hope I can keep
a war from starting.

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:24.300
Well, Princess Amelia.
Welcome to our distant land.

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:26.800
King Moros! Hear my words!

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:29.470
We have evidence that
you're building up...

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:32.480
...troop strength far above
what our treaty allows!

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:36.310
If you continue your military
build-up at this rate...

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:40.650
...then, in the name of justice,
Seyruun shall consider you an enemy!

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:46.320
Princess Amelia, our military
build-up is purely defensive.

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:49.660
Silence! Even if it is defensive...

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:52.500
...this build-up is seen as a threat
by other kingdoms!

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:55.670
If you cause unnecessary tensions
to rise between them...

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:58.170
...a war will eventually break out!

00:09:58.170 --> 00:10:01.160
And when that happens,
do you intend to take responsibility?!

00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:12.020
Your form is terrible!

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:15.690
When you land, you should
turn your body like this-!

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:18.360
We won't take any
orders from you!

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:22.850
Our responsibility...
is to take over the world!

00:10:38.540 --> 00:10:40.380
Take over the world?!

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:44.550
Exactly! And then we'll sacrifice the world
to the monstrous Zoamelgustar!

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:48.220
Uh, actually I just want to use
the army to take over the world...

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:49.720
And, sooner or later...

00:10:49.720 --> 00:10:53.220
...the biggest threat to
my plans will be Seyruun!

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:54.390
Not only do you wish to
take over the world...

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:56.890
...you desire to sacrifice it
to a horrible monster!

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:58.560
By any other name,
that is evil!

00:10:58.560 --> 00:11:00.830
Heaven may forgive you,
but Amelia will not!

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:05.170
Just the words I was waiting for.
Everyone! Capture this girl!

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:08.170
Um, I am the king, Martina,
so maybe I should...

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:09.340
Father, shut up!

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:10.510
Yes, dear.

00:11:10.510 --> 00:11:11.500
Get her!

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:15.340
Burst Rondo!

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:23.190
It looks like her sorcery
really is pretty powerful.

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:24.680
Well, we have our own!

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:38.200
Mr. Zelgadis!

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:42.210
To think we would
meet again like this...

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:44.880
Such is destiny.

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:47.210
What are you doing here,
Mr. Zelgadis?

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:50.550
I'm working for this kingdom.
In other words...

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:53.720
...you and I are now enemies!

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:55.220
Oh, no!

00:11:55.220 --> 00:11:57.720
Lately, I'd almost started to think
of myself as an easygoing guy...

00:11:57.720 --> 00:11:59.720
...but this is my true form!

00:11:59.720 --> 00:12:02.830
Oh, for two people who once battled
together in the name of justice...

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:05.830
...to have to meet again in battle!

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:07.330
What a dramatic situation!

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:08.830
Hey!

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:12.500
You know how powerful I am, Amelia.

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:19.510
I couldn't seriously fight
one of my old comrades.

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:24.510
But if I show any mercy to him,
there's no way I can win!

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:26.680
Still, if I appeaI to him
as an old friend...

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:30.680
... he'll see the big picture
and realize that justice is-

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:33.690
Hey! When did this happen?!

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:36.030
A clever plan, Mr. Zelgadis!

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:39.860
You used my love of justice against me
in an act of psychological warfare!

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:42.200
Uh, actually no, but...

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:49.540
Here I am, captured for
the sake of world peace...

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:51.210
Oh, how beautiful...

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:54.210
Uh, hello? Should you really be
getting into this so much?

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:57.710
Right! When you think about it,
this isn't how I'm supposed to act!

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:01.150
I want to be the hero who rescues
the captured princess!

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:03.150
I don't know what
you're talking about...

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:05.660
...but now Seyruun will have
to do what I say!

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:07.660
No, not as you say.

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:09.830
No! I may be caught in your plot...

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:11.660
...but justice will triumph in the end!

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:13.500
I may be imprisoned for now...

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:17.160
...but I know some justice- loving
person will save me!

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:21.170
Wha- Wha- What?

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:22.840
A Seyruun sneak attack!

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:24.010
It can't be!

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:25.670
Mega Brando!

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:32.020
I came to save you, Amelia!

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:34.350
Wh- Who the hell are you?!

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:36.850
Well, though it is a little presumptuous
to introduce myself this way...

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:40.690
...I am the beautiful young
sorcery genius, Lina Inverse!

00:13:40.690 --> 00:13:41.360
Hey!

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:44.360
What? I've got a good scene
going here. Don't interrupt!

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:47.850
Never mind that. I think you
blew up Amelia along with them.

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:51.190
Are you all right, Amelia?

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:55.040
No, I'm not all right!

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:57.040
Miss Lina, how could you do that?!

00:13:57.040 --> 00:14:00.310
Sorry. I guess it's been a while
since I used my full power.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:03.150
Besides, I was worried
about you. So what?

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.820
That isn't an excuse!

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:09.150
Anyway, I heard the whole story.
Your evil scheme ends here!

00:14:09.150 --> 00:14:10.490
Father!

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:12.160
Lina Inverse?!

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:13.820
You mean the walking
force of destruction?

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:15.990
The natural enemy
of all who live?!

00:14:15.990 --> 00:14:19.160
The girl who leaves wreckage
and chaos in her wake?!

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:21.670
- Lina, the Dragon Spooker-
- Give it a rest!

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:23.000
Get her!

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:29.340
Sorry for the late introduction...

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:31.500
...but I'm Lina's guardian,
Gourry Gabriev!

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:34.840
M- Master Zelgadis!

00:14:38.010 --> 00:14:41.350
Miss Lina! Mr. Zelgadis
is working for them!

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:44.180
He even called me an enemy!

00:14:50.190 --> 00:14:52.030
Well, it sure looks that way.

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:54.530
Sorry, but as long as my employers
don't betray me...

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:56.870
...I can't break my contract with them.

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:59.370
That's an admirable professional ethic.

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:02.640
Master Zelgadis! Go get them!

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:04.980
Lina... I must kill you.

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:07.810
Hold it, Zelgadis!
Are you serious?!

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:11.150
I'm doing this so that I can
regain my human form.

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:13.480
Regain your human form?

00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:18.150
Yes. In return for protecting them,
I get the Book of Xoana.

00:15:19.990 --> 00:15:21.830
Oh, you mean this thing?

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:25.160
Th- That's the Book of Xoana!
How did you get it?!

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:26.830
When I snuck into
the castle earlier...

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:29.000
...this accidentally
fell out of the vault.

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:30.830
Didn't want to waste the chance,
so I took it with me.

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:32.170
You thief!

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:36.510
Miss Lina, you mean you didn't come because
you were worried and wanted to save me?

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:39.180
Well, I suppose
that's one way to put it.

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:42.510
The thing is, this book's
of no use to Zelgadis!

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:46.350
All that's written in it are
ancient methods of making golems.

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:47.520
That's all!

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:49.180
W- Well!

00:15:50.850 --> 00:15:53.520
I won't support your
evil plans any longer!

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:56.860
That guy has the easiest
behavior pattern to predict...

00:15:58.860 --> 00:15:59.700
Oh! He's getting away!

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:00.730
After him!

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:16.480
Now, then, you've got five choices here.

00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:18.980
One, you can be punished by me.

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:21.150
Two, you can be punished by Gourry.

00:16:21.150 --> 00:16:23.490
Three, you can be punished by Amelia.

00:16:23.490 --> 00:16:26.490
Four, you can be punished by Zelgadis.

00:16:26.490 --> 00:16:27.820
And the last is having
you all do it together?

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:29.160
What else?

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:30.320
Well...

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:34.660
Why don't you offer me some money
to forget about all this?

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:35.490
You idiot!

00:16:40.170 --> 00:16:41.840
Now look, I'm serious.

00:16:41.840 --> 00:16:45.510
Just beating up this one guy
isn't gonna fatten my purse any.

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:47.340
You can't do that!

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:50.350
Hm... How much would
you ask for, anyway?

00:16:50.350 --> 00:16:52.180
Maybe this castle
and everything around it?

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:53.840
Who would pay that?!

00:16:56.520 --> 00:16:59.860
Well, no choice, then.
Guess I'll beat him up myself!

00:16:59.860 --> 00:17:02.450
I knew you'd end up doing that!

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:14.970
That's the ultimate weapon passed down
with the Book of Xoana!

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:18.460
Come forth, Orihalcon Golem!

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:23.980
What the heck is that?

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:26.980
Is that what's written about
in the Book of Xoana?

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:30.320
This golem's body will reflect
common spells...

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:32.810
...and can withstand
direct attacks as well!

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:38.330
Awaken from your thousand years
of sleep, Golem!

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:40.160
Father! Leave this to me!

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:43.500
Oh... I thought she ran off before!
So, that's where she went.

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:46.500
Now, in the name of
the monstrous Zoamelgustar...

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:48.160
...let's go!

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:50.510
I don't think she's got
both oars in the water.

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:52.510
The monstrous Zoamelgustar?

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:53.840
You know about him?

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:57.010
I thought I knew most legends
and folk tales pretty well...

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:59.020
...but I've never heard of him.

00:17:59.020 --> 00:18:01.780
I'm not surprised you've
never heard of him.

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:04.790
The monstrous Zoamelgustar...

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:08.120
...is something I made up myself!

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:09.960
Like I care?!

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:11.450
Here we go!

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:32.980
Did you see that?!
The power of our golem!

00:18:32.980 --> 00:18:34.320
Be thankful!

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:38.320
I'll make you the first sacrifices
to the monstrous Zoamelgustar!

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:40.160
You've gotta be kidding!

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:41.320
Prepare to die!

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:50.160
Hey! Hey!!

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:03.780
When you think about it, it was
passed down with the magic book.

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:06.280
Meaning that golem was
pretty darned old.

00:19:06.280 --> 00:19:09.450
You mean it doesn't
work right anymore?

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:10.950
Help. Uh, a little help here,
please?

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:12.120
Hey, you people!

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:13.290
Are you just going to stand
there watching?!

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:14.960
Do something!

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:17.120
Well, what are we supposed to do?

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:23.800
Oh. It's out of control.

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:26.970
Stop it! Agh! Stop it! Please!

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:28.470
And just how are we
supposed to stop it?

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:31.640
If common spells and direct attacks
won't work on it...

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:34.640
...then you have to use
an Uncommon spell!

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:36.130
Yeah, I guess...

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:41.480
This is a Dragon Slave Alert!

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:44.820
All citizens, please evacuate
as quickly as possible!

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:50.160
"Darkness beyond twilight,
crimson beyond blood that flows!"

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:53.330
"Buried in the flow of time."

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:57.000
"In thy great name,
I pledge myself to darkness."

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:59.000
"All the fools who stand
in our way shall be destroyed..."

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:03.000
"...by the power you and I possess!"

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:07.840
Dragon Slave!!!

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:15.850
I know I said common spells
wouldn't work, but-!

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:29.200
Well, if they were lucky,
they were saved.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:32.200
You really think luck would have
saved them from that just now?

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:33.540
It doesn't really matter, does it?

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:37.370
At the very least, we definitely
destroyed evil here...

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:40.040
What's wrong, Amelia?
Why so down?

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:44.710
I can't go back to
Seyruun like this!

00:20:52.220 --> 00:20:53.390
Those...

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:55.060
Mark my words!

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:57.390
In the name of the monstrous
Zoamelgustar...

00:20:57.390 --> 00:21:00.660
...I shall have my revenge!

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:18.350
Something's taken control now.

00:21:18.350 --> 00:21:22.020
Your life's hopes and dreams are gone.

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:26.850
Are you satisfied with your life now?

00:21:28.190 --> 00:21:32.700
Got that fin de siecle feeling...

00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:37.030
... and spend every day preparing.

00:21:37.030 --> 00:21:40.200
So let's get your engine running!

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:42.540
Throw off all of...

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:46.030
... that rusty common sense!

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:51.380
You want to be the talk of the world!

00:21:51.380 --> 00:21:54.550
You want to have a shining future!

00:21:54.550 --> 00:21:57.050
That and this are your true dreams.

00:21:57.050 --> 00:22:00.820
Don't let anyone get in your way!

00:22:01.820 --> 00:22:05.830
To be the talk of the world...

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:09.500
... let the greatness inside burst out!

00:22:09.500 --> 00:22:11.830
You only get one break in life...

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:13.500
... so let's say bye- bye...

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:14.840
... to your timid self!

00:22:14.840 --> 00:22:17.500
It's all right!

00:22:20.990 --> 00:22:23.150
You're requesting for me to look
for the Claire Bible manuscripts?

00:22:23.150 --> 00:22:25.990
Where, where?! Where are
the Claire Bible manuscripts at?

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:27.890
By the way, who are you?

00:22:27.890 --> 00:22:31.830
Next Episode is: " The Roguish Priest!
His Name is Xellos!"

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:34.320
If you don't watch,
I'll go berserk!
